@page "/"

<PageTitle>Day 5 Practice - Effects and Async</PageTitle>

<h1>Day 5 Practice: Effects and Async Operations</h1>

<p class="lead">
    Three exercises to practice Fluxor effects and the triple-action pattern.
</p>

<div class="row mt-3">
    <div class="col-md-4">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h5 class="card-title">Practice 1: Todo Load Effect</h5>
                <p class="card-text">Add async loading to the existing todo store using ITodoService.</p>
                <span class="badge bg-info">Guided -- 15 min</span>
                <a href="todo" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm mt-2 d-block">Go to Todo</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-4">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h5 class="card-title">Practice 2: Product Catalog</h5>
                <p class="card-text">Build the full triple-action pattern for product loading.</p>
                <span class="badge bg-warning text-dark">Independent -- 25 min</span>
                <a href="products" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm mt-2 d-block">Go to Products</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-4">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h5 class="card-title">Practice 3: Retry + Empty State</h5>
                <p class="card-text">Add retry button and empty-state handling to your product catalog.</p>
                <span class="badge bg-danger">Challenge -- 10 min</span>
                <a href="products" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm mt-2 d-block">Go to Products</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
